    <briefdescription>
<para>AQL query evaluator using token-level Jaccard similarity. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>RS = |tokens(original) ∩ tokens(recovered)| / |tokens(original) ∪ tokens(recovered)|</para>
<para>Tokenisation splits on whitespace and punctuation, preserving AQL keywords, identifiers, and string literals as individual tokens. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
